--- Basic Inline frame
:::code; yes :::

--- Inline frame with a single param
:::mode; cat; yes :::

--- Inline frame with multiple params
:::mode; cat, dog; yes :::

--- Basic block frame 
:::code
meow
:::

--- Block frame with 2 params
:::code; cat, dog
meow
:::

--- Block frame with multiple params and multiline payload
:::code; cat, dog
cat
dog 
bunny
:::

--- Block frame with multiple params and decorated payload
:::code; cat, dog
*cat*
/dog/
bunny!
:::
